+# Integrated IT Support Inc. — Master Listing Copy Pack
+
+One source of truth for every directory, portal, supplier register, and profile.
+Copy from here. Never retype from memory — inconsistent name/address/phone (NAP) data
+is the single fastest way to tank local search ranking and get a Google Business Profile
+flagged.
+
+Last updated: 2026-07-29
+
+---
+
+## 1. Canonical NAP block — use this exact text everywhere
+
+```
+Integrated IT Support Inc.
+30 Fothergill Court
+Whitby, Ontario  L1P 1L4
+Canada
+(647) 581-3182
+https://iisupp.net
+integrateditsupp@gmail.com
+```
+
+Rules that are not optional:
+
+- Legal name is **Integrated IT Support Inc.** — with the period on "Inc." Do not list as
+  "Integrated IT Support", "IIS", "IISupport", or "iisupp.net". Directories match on exact
+  string; variants create duplicate entities.
+- Postal code is **L1P 1L4**. Some older outbound templates carry **L1P 2L4** — that is
+  wrong, and under CASL an inaccurate physical address in a commercial email is a defect.
+  Fix it wherever it appears before it propagates into a public listing.
+- Phone renders as **(647) 581-3182** in North American forms and **+1 647 581 3182**
+  in international forms (UAE, Saudi, Qatar, UN). Same number, format matched to region.
+- Website is always `https://iisupp.net` — with `https`, without `www`.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Business classification codes
+
+Most procurement registers and B2B directories ask for these. Having them ready turns a
+25-minute registration into a 6-minute one.
+
+| System | Code | Label |
+|---|---|---|
+| NAICS (Canada/US) | **541512** | Computer Systems Design Services |
+| NAICS secondary | **541519** | Other Computer Related Services |
+| NAICS secondary | **811210** | Electronic and Precision Equipment Repair and Maintenance |
+| NAICS secondary | **541511** | Custom Computer Programming Services |
+| UNSPSC | **81111800** | Computer services |
+| UNSPSC | **81111500** | Software or hardware engineering |
+| UNSPSC | **81112200** | Data services |
+| UNSPSC | **81111700** | Information technology consulting services |
+| UNSPSC | **43230000** | Software |
+| UNSPSC | **43220000** | Data voice or multimedia network equipment |
+| GSIN (CanadaBuys) | **D302** | IT and telecom — systems development |
+| GSIN (CanadaBuys) | **D399** | IT and telecom — other |
+| GSIN (CanadaBuys) | **N7030** | ADP software |
+| SIC (legacy/intl) | **7379** | Computer Rental and Leasing / Computer Services |
+
+Primary category string for directories that use free text:
+**Computer Support and Services** — with **Managed IT Service Provider (MSP)**,
+**IT Consultant**, **Computer Security Service**, and **Website Designer** as secondaries.
+
+---
+
+## 3. Profile copy by character limit
+
+Every listing form has a different cap. These are pre-fitted. Use the largest one that
+fits without truncation — a sentence cut off mid-word reads as abandonment.
+
+### 40 characters — app tiles, short taglines
+```
+Managed IT support for Ontario business
+```
+
+### 80 characters — directory taglines, LinkedIn headline
+```
+Managed IT, cybersecurity and Microsoft 365 support for Ontario businesses.
+```
+
+### 160 characters — meta descriptions, Google Business short description
+```
+Integrated IT Support Inc. delivers managed IT, helpdesk, Microsoft 365, cybersecurity and network support to small and mid-sized businesses across Ontario.
+```
+
+### 300 characters — most B2B directory "about" fields
+```
+Integrated IT Support Inc. is a Whitby, Ontario managed service provider delivering helpdesk support, Microsoft 365 administration, network and server management, cybersecurity, backup and disaster recovery to small and mid-sized businesses. Flat monthly pricing. Response times in writing.
+```
+
+### 600 characters — supplier registers, partner directories
+```
+Integrated IT Support Inc. is a Canadian managed service provider based in Whitby, Ontario, supporting small and mid-sized businesses, professional practices and public-sector teams across the Greater Toronto Area and remotely nationwide.
+
+We run the whole IT function so our clients do not have to: unlimited helpdesk, Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace administration, network and server management, cybersecurity monitoring, backup and disaster recovery, procurement and vendor management. Flat monthly pricing, documented response times, and no long lock-in contracts.
+```
+
+### 1500 characters — capability statements, RFP vendor profiles, UNGM/UAE/Etimad
+```
+Integrated IT Support Inc. is a Canadian managed service provider headquartered in Whitby, Ontario. We act as the complete IT department for small and mid-sized organizations that need enterprise-grade reliability without an enterprise-sized payroll — professional practices, multi-site trades and retail operations, non-profits, and public-sector teams across the Greater Toronto Area, with remote coverage nationwide.
+
+Core services:
+- Managed IT and unlimited helpdesk support, L1 through L3
+- Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace deployment, migration, security hardening and administration
+- Network design, Wi-Fi, VPN, firewall and structured connectivity
+- Server installation, virtualization, patching and lifecycle management
+- Cybersecurity: vulnerability assessment, penetration testing, endpoint protection, security awareness
+- Backup, disaster recovery and business continuity planning
+- Cloud migration and hybrid infrastructure
+- Compliance readiness support for HIPAA, PCI DSS and SOC 2 programs
+- Hardware and software procurement, asset lifecycle and vendor management
+- Web design, hosting, and business process automation
+
+How we work: flat monthly pricing so budgets are predictable, response times committed in writing, documented environments so knowledge is never trapped in one person's head, and month-to-month terms because we would rather earn renewal than enforce it.
+
+Integrated IT Support Inc. is fully insured and carries commercial general liability and
+errors and omissions coverage. References available on request.
+```
+
